WEBVTT

00:00:12.315 --> 00:00:13.515
Don't you worry.

00:00:13.915 --> 00:00:17.435
I'm gonna make sure
that tomorrow is another great day.

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:19.475
I promise.

00:00:20.675 --> 00:00:21.755
(RILEY GIGGLES)

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:29.115
(ENERGETIC MUSIC PLAYING)

00:00:32.555 --> 00:00:33.875
Hello! Did I wake you?

00:00:33.955 --> 00:00:36.195
-ANGER: Do you have to play that?
-Well, I have to practice.

00:00:36.275 --> 00:00:38.955
And I don't think of it as playing
so much as hugging.

00:00:40.675 --> 00:00:41.555
Okay, first day of school!

00:00:41.635 --> 00:00:42.675
Very, very exciting.

00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:44.875
I was up late last night
figuring out a new plan.

00:00:44.955 --> 00:00:46.315
-Here it is! Fear.
-(GASPS)

00:00:46.395 --> 00:00:47.875
I need a list of all the possible

00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:50.075
negative outcomes
on the first day at a new school.

00:00:50.155 --> 00:00:52.235
Way ahead of you there. Does anyone
know how to spell "meteor"?

00:00:52.355 --> 00:00:54.315
Disgust. Make sure
Riley stands out today.

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:55.635
But also blends in.

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:57.635
When I'm through,
Riley will look so good,

00:00:57.715 --> 00:00:59.835
the other kids will
look at their own outfits and barf.

00:00:59.955 --> 00:01:00.955
"Joy." "Yes, Joy?"

00:01:01.075 --> 00:01:02.435
"You'll be in charge of the console,

00:01:02.555 --> 00:01:03.915
"keeping Riley happy all day long.

00:01:04.035 --> 00:01:05.675
"And may I add I love
your dress? It's adorable."

00:01:05.755 --> 00:01:07.195
"Oh, this old thing? Thank you so much.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:08.395
"I love the way it twirls."

00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:11.115
-(TRAIN HORN BLOWS)
-Train of Thought! Right on schedule.

00:01:11.195 --> 00:01:12.675
(TRAIN HONKS HORN)

00:01:13.715 --> 00:01:15.235
Anger. Unload the daydreams.

00:01:15.435 --> 00:01:17.635
I ordered extra
in case things get slow in class.

00:01:17.755 --> 00:01:19.715
It might come in handy.
If this new school is full of

00:01:19.795 --> 00:01:22.635
boring, useless classes.
Which it probably will be.

00:01:22.755 --> 00:01:26.355
Oh. Sadness. I have
a super important job just for you.

00:01:26.595 --> 00:01:28.315
-Really?
-Mmm-hmm. Follow me.

00:01:30.635 --> 00:01:33.155
-What are you doing?
-And there. Perfect!

00:01:33.315 --> 00:01:35.275
This is the circle of Sadness.

00:01:35.435 --> 00:01:37.155
Your job is to make sure that

00:01:37.275 --> 00:01:39.715
all the Sadness stays inside of it.

00:01:40.115 --> 00:01:42.635
So you want me to just stand here?

00:01:42.795 --> 00:01:45.555
Hey, it's not my place to
tell you how to do your job.

00:01:45.755 --> 00:01:49.075
Just make sure that all the Sadness

00:01:49.155 --> 00:01:50.355
stays in the circle!

00:01:50.515 --> 00:01:53.675
See? You're a pro at this! Isn't this fun?

00:01:53.755 --> 00:01:54.795
-No.
-Atta girl.

00:01:54.915 --> 00:01:56.155
All right, everyone, fresh start.

00:01:56.235 --> 00:01:58.395
We are gonna have a good day,
which will turn into a good week,

00:01:58.475 --> 00:01:59.555
which will turn into a good year,

00:01:59.675 --> 00:02:00.675
which turns into a good life!

00:02:00.995 --> 00:02:04.115
So, the big day!
New school, new friends, huh?

00:02:04.195 --> 00:02:06.435
I know! I'm kind of nervous,
but I'm mostly excited.

00:02:06.515 --> 00:02:08.155
How do I look? Do you like my shirt?

00:02:08.235 --> 00:02:09.515
MOM: Very cute!

00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:11.475
Are you gonna be okay?
You want us to walk with you?

00:02:11.595 --> 00:02:13.995
Mom and Dad? With us in public?
No thank you.

00:02:14.195 --> 00:02:15.195
Uh... I'm on it!

00:02:15.315 --> 00:02:17.475
Nope! I'm fine. Bye, Mom. Bye, Dad.

00:02:17.675 --> 00:02:18.795
Have a good day at school, monkey.

00:02:19.235 --> 00:02:21.355
(IMITATING MONKEY GRUNTING)

00:02:24.475 --> 00:02:25.915
MOM: Have a great day, sweetheart!

00:02:26.715 --> 00:02:28.115
GIRL 1: That's crazy. It really is.

00:02:28.195 --> 00:02:29.195
GIRL 2: That was so funny.

00:02:30.235 --> 00:02:32.035
BOY: Do you know
what basketball game is coming up?

00:02:33.075 --> 00:02:34.115
FEAR: Are you sure we want to do this?

00:02:34.195 --> 00:02:37.195
JOY: In we go!
FEAR: Okay! Going in! Yes!

00:02:38.195 --> 00:02:39.835
(INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS)

00:02:41.715 --> 00:02:42.755
GIRL: Did you see her? Hello!

00:02:42.835 --> 00:02:44.755
DISGUST: Okay, we've got
a group of cool girls at two o'clock.

00:02:44.835 --> 00:02:46.155
-How do you know?
-Double ears pierced,

00:02:46.235 --> 00:02:47.315
infinity scarf.

00:02:47.395 --> 00:02:48.715
JOY: Whoa. Is she
wearing eye shadow?

00:02:48.795 --> 00:02:50.755
-Yeah, we want to be friends with them.
-Let's go talk to them!

00:02:50.835 --> 00:02:52.595
Are you kidding?
We're not talking to them.

00:02:52.715 --> 00:02:53.955
We want them to like us.

00:02:54.075 --> 00:02:55.355
Oh. Yeah. Wait, what?

00:02:55.515 --> 00:02:57.315
Almost finished
with the potential disasters.

00:02:57.395 --> 00:02:59.595
Worst scenario is either quicksand,

00:02:59.715 --> 00:03:01.075
spontaneous combustion,

00:03:01.235 --> 00:03:02.875
or getting called on by the teacher.

00:03:03.035 --> 00:03:04.235
So as long as none of those happen...

00:03:04.355 --> 00:03:06.875
Okay, everybody.
We have a new student in class today.

00:03:07.035 --> 00:03:09.035
Are you kidding me? Out of the gate?

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:10.195
This is not happening!

00:03:10.475 --> 00:03:13.115
Riley, would you like
to tell us something about yourself?

00:03:13.235 --> 00:03:15.355
No! Pretend we can't speak English.

00:03:15.435 --> 00:03:16.635
Don't worry. I got this.

00:03:17.755 --> 00:03:19.235
Uh... Okay.

00:03:19.755 --> 00:03:21.355
My name is Riley Andersen.

00:03:21.515 --> 00:03:24.635
I'm from Minnesota and now I live here.

00:03:26.955 --> 00:03:29.275
TEACHER: And how about Minnesota?

00:03:29.355 --> 00:03:30.595
Can you tell us something about it?

00:03:30.715 --> 00:03:32.915
Well, you certainly
get a lot more snow than we do.

00:03:33.115 --> 00:03:34.795
(LAUGHING)

00:03:35.275 --> 00:03:36.875
She's hilarious!

00:03:38.555 --> 00:03:40.075
Yeah, it gets pretty cold.

00:03:40.195 --> 00:03:41.195
The lake freezes over,

00:03:41.275 --> 00:03:42.635
and that's when we play hockey.

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.875
I'm on a great team.
We're called the Prairie Dogs.

00:03:45.115 --> 00:03:47.755
My friend Meg plays forward.
And my dad's the coach.

00:03:48.475 --> 00:03:50.635
Pretty much everyone
in my family skates.

00:03:50.995 --> 00:03:52.355
It's kind of a family tradition.

00:03:52.435 --> 00:03:54.235
We go out on the lake
almost every weekend.

00:03:57.235 --> 00:03:59.955
Or we did, till I moved away.

00:04:00.075 --> 00:04:01.155
-Hey, what gives?
-Wait, what?

00:04:01.595 --> 00:04:05.075
Hey, Sadness! You touched
a memory? We talked about this.

00:04:05.155 --> 00:04:06.915
Oh, yeah, I know. I'm sorry.

00:04:06.995 --> 00:04:10.075
Get back in your circle.
(SIGHS) What's going on?

00:04:10.235 --> 00:04:11.315
-Why won't it eject?
-Get it out of there, Joy.

00:04:12.275 --> 00:04:14.595
(SNIFFLING) We used
to play tag and stuff.

00:04:14.675 --> 00:04:15.955
Cool kids whispering at three o'clock!

00:04:16.475 --> 00:04:17.475
FEAR: Did you see that look?
JOY: Oh, no.

00:04:17.595 --> 00:04:18.595
They're judging us!

00:04:18.915 --> 00:04:19.915
(ALL STRAINING)

00:04:20.075 --> 00:04:22.395
JOY: Somebody help me!
Grab that... Everybody put...

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:24.875
But everything's different now.

00:04:25.715 --> 00:04:26.755
Since we moved.

00:04:28.115 --> 00:04:29.115
(SNIFFLES)

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:32.715
Oh, no! We're crying! At school!

00:04:32.835 --> 00:04:35.115
What? Sadness! What are you doing?

00:04:36.155 --> 00:04:38.435
Oh, no! Oh, I'm sorry!

00:04:38.795 --> 00:04:39.835
JOY: Huh?

00:04:39.955 --> 00:04:41.675
FEAR: (GASPS) It's a Core Memory!

00:04:41.875 --> 00:04:43.315
But it's blue.

00:04:43.915 --> 00:04:44.955
(ALL GASP)

00:04:45.035 --> 00:04:48.515
No! Wait! Stop it! No! Ah! No!

00:04:55.675 --> 00:04:56.835
Joy, no.

00:04:56.995 --> 00:04:58.435
-That's a Core Memory!
-Hey!

00:04:58.515 --> 00:04:59.715
-Joy, wait!
-Stop it! Let go!

00:05:00.475 --> 00:05:02.075
FEAR: Ah! The Core Memories!

00:05:06.555 --> 00:05:07.555
(EXCLAIMS)

00:05:11.155 --> 00:05:12.155
(GASPS)

00:05:16.995 --> 00:05:18.155
No, no, no, no!

00:05:21.635 --> 00:05:23.675
-Whoa!
-Whoa!

00:05:24.675 --> 00:05:25.675
(FEAR GASPS)

00:05:31.475 --> 00:05:32.795
TEACHER: Thank you, Riley.

00:05:32.955 --> 00:05:35.355
I know it can be tough
moving to a new place,

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:37.235
but we're happy to have you here.

00:05:37.955 --> 00:05:39.995
All right, everyone,
get out your history books

00:05:40.155 --> 00:05:41.675
and turn to chapter seven.

00:05:44.395 --> 00:05:46.035
Can I say that curse word now?

00:05:46.635 --> 00:05:48.435
(BOTH EXCLAIMING)

00:06:03.715 --> 00:06:05.795
-(SADNESS SCREAMING)
-Ah!

00:06:07.195 --> 00:06:10.395
Oh, no! One, two, three. Okay.

00:06:11.675 --> 00:06:14.795
I got them. Where are we?

00:06:15.995 --> 00:06:18.235
Long Term Memory? Wait...

00:06:24.795 --> 00:06:26.315
Goofball Island?

00:06:27.595 --> 00:06:29.555
SADNESS:
Riley's Islands of Personality.

00:06:29.675 --> 00:06:31.155
They're all down!

00:06:31.995 --> 00:06:33.915
Oh! This is bad.

00:06:33.995 --> 00:06:36.035
We... We can fix this!

00:06:36.715 --> 00:06:38.435
We just have to
get back to Headquarters,

00:06:38.555 --> 00:06:39.995
plug the Core Memories in,

00:06:40.075 --> 00:06:41.755
and Riley will be back to normal.

00:06:42.955 --> 00:06:45.155
Riley has no Core Memories.

00:06:45.235 --> 00:06:47.355
No Personality Islands and no...

00:06:47.435 --> 00:06:48.475
(GASPS)

00:06:48.595 --> 00:06:49.635
What? What is it?

00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:50.875
You.

00:06:51.035 --> 00:06:52.755
You're not in Headquarters.

00:06:52.915 --> 00:06:55.515
Without you, Riley can't be happy.

00:06:56.235 --> 00:06:57.795
We got to get you back up there.

00:06:58.555 --> 00:06:59.795
I'm coming, Riley.

